WEBVTT

00:25:27.954 --> 00:25:33.038
By then, she said the wonderful story
of how a hen laid an egg.

00:25:33.913 --> 00:25:37.038
And when I announced age 10 that
I was going to go to Africa

00:25:37.038 --> 00:25:39.496
and live with wild animals and
write books about them,

00:25:40.704 --> 00:25:44.746
everybody laughed at me because I was
a girl and war was raging then

00:25:45.121 --> 00:25:48.038
and Africa was far away when
we have basically no money.

00:25:48.413 --> 00:25:50.871
But Mum said, if you really want
to do something like this,

00:25:50.871 --> 00:25:54.954
you could end up to work awfully hard to
take advantage of every opportunity.

00:25:55.163 --> 00:25:57.704
And then maybe if you don't
give up, you'll find the.

00:25:58.704 --> 00:26:01.371
That's what I've told young people
all around the world,